tools/sit: StuffIt 1.5.1-compatible (Classic SIT, stored) archive writer for MoofPort's
hardware-session bundles (scripts/hw-bundle.py).

Origin: copied from MoofTCP (../mooftcp/tools/sit, commit ac5c0ce), which took it from SitStill
(SitStill), MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 SitStill contributors; the license text is
in LICENSE next to this file.
Copied unchanged from MoofTCP: classic_sit_writer.c, stream.c, sit_crc.c, classic_sit_internal.h,
sitstill/classic_sit.h, sitstill/stream.h.
mksit.c: MoofTCP's driver, extended for MoofPort with folders ("+Name" opens a folder, "-" closes
it), using the writer's records API.
